{{!-- Doctor tier-confirmation reminder — bilingual.

      For the doctor who is already through the door: account approved,
      password set, services pre-ticked, one screen left. doctor-welcome.hbs
      opens with "set your password", which is the wrong sentence for someone
      who set one weeks ago — and is very likely part of why six of them
      stopped reading.

      No magic-login token: these doctors have a password. Linking one would
      email a second live credential for no reason.

      EDIT ALL FOUR BLOCKS. Two files (en/, ar/) x two language blocks each.
      Both carry BOTH languages, ordered so the block matching user.lang comes
      first — same convention as doctor-welcome.hbs. Editing only the top block
      of each file is the mistake that shipped an email naming the 18-hour tier
      two different things in its two halves.

      PLURALISATION IS PRE-RENDERED. servicesPhrase / servicesPhraseAr arrive
      as finished noun phrases from routes/superadmin.js, not as a bare count.
      "all 1 of the services" shipped to a real inbox on 2026-08-29; Arabic is
      worse than a plural s, needing singular, dual, 3-10 and 11+ forms. That
      is a language problem, not a template problem, so it is solved in code.

      BODY PARTIAL — renderEmail() wraps it in _layout.hbs.

      Variables: firstName, firstNameAr, specialtyEn, specialtyAr,
                 servicesPhrase, servicesPhraseAr, servicesUrl, launchDate,
                 launchDateAr.

      Handlebars comment, stripped at compile time. Never write comment
      delimiters or mustache braces inside it. --}}

<!-- ================= ENGLISH ================= -->
<div dir="ltr" style="text-align:left;">

<h1 style="margin:0 0 22px;font:400 24px/1.4 Georgia,'Times New Roman',serif;color:#0B6B5F;">
  One step left on your Tashkheesa account
</h1>

<p style="margin:0 0 18px;font:400 16px/1.75 -apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Arial,sans-serif;color:#2E2B26;">
  Dear Dr. {{firstName}},
</p>

<p style="margin:0 0 18px;font:400 15px/1.75 -apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Arial,sans-serif;color:#2E2B26;">
  Your account is approved and active{{#if specialtyEn}} in <strong style="color:#0B6B5F;font-weight:600;">{{specialtyEn}}</strong>{{/if}}. There is one thing left before cases can reach you: confirming which turnaround times you are willing to take.
</p>

{{#if launchDate}}
<p style="margin:0 0 18px;font:400 15px/1.75 -apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Arial,sans-serif;color:#2E2B26;">
  We open to patients on <strong>{{launchDate}}</strong>. Only specialists who have confirmed their turnarounds can be assigned a case, so this is worth the minute it takes.
</p>
{{/if}}

<p style="margin:0 0 18px;font:400 15px/1.75 -apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Arial,sans-serif;color:#2E2B26;">
  We have already ticked {{servicesPhrase}} for you, so this is a review rather than a form to fill in. Untick anything you would rather not take.
</p>

<p style="margin:0 0 18px;font:400 15px/1.75 -apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Arial,sans-serif;color:#2E2B26;">
  The three turnarounds are <strong>standard (48 hours)</strong>, <strong>fast track (18 hours)</strong> and <strong>urgent (4 hours, 7am&ndash;7pm Cairo time)</strong>. If a deadline is missed we refund the patient's urgency surcharge, so pick the tiers that fit how you actually work.
</p>

<p style="margin:0 0 26px;">
  <a href="{{servicesUrl}}" style="display:inline-block;padding:13px 26px;background:#0B6B5F;color:#ffffff;text-decoration:none;border-radius:6px;font:600 15px/1 -apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Arial,sans-serif;">
    Confirm my services
  </a>
</p>

<p style="margin:0 0 8px;font:400 14px/1.7 -apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Arial,sans-serif;color:#6B655C;">
  If you have forgotten your password, use "Forgot password" on the sign-in page. Reply to this email if anything is unclear &mdash; it reaches a person.
</p>

</div>

<div style="height:1px;background:#E6E1D8;margin:34px 0;"></div>

<!-- ================= ARABIC ================= -->
<div dir="rtl" style="text-align:right;">

<h1 style="margin:0 0 22px;font:400 24px/1.4 Georgia,'Times New Roman',serif;color:#0B6B5F;">
  خطوة واحدة متبقية في حسابك على تشخيصة
</h1>

<p style="margin:0 0 18px;font:400 16px/1.75 -apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Arial,sans-serif;color:#2E2B26;">
  عزيزي د. {{firstNameAr}}،
</p>

<p style="margin:0 0 18px;font:400 15px/1.75 -apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Arial,sans-serif;color:#2E2B26;">
  حسابك معتمد ومفعّل{{#if specialtyAr}} في تخصص <strong style="color:#0B6B5F;font-weight:600;">{{specialtyAr}}</strong>{{/if}}. بقيت خطوة واحدة قبل أن تصلك الحالات: تأكيد مدد التسليم التي توافق على العمل بها.
</p>

{{#if launchDateAr}}
<p style="margin:0 0 18px;font:400 15px/1.75 -apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Arial,sans-serif;color:#2E2B26;">
  نفتح المنصة للمرضى في <strong>{{launchDateAr}}</strong>. لا يمكن إسناد الحالات إلا للأطباء الذين أكّدوا مدد التسليم، لذا تستحق الدقيقة التي تستغرقها.
</p>
{{/if}}

<p style="margin:0 0 18px;font:400 15px/1.75 -apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Arial,sans-serif;color:#2E2B26;">
  قمنا بتحديد {{servicesPhraseAr}} نيابةً عنك، لذا الأمر مراجعة وليس نموذجاً تملؤه. أزل التحديد عن أي خدمة لا ترغب في استقبالها.
</p>

<p style="margin:0 0 18px;font:400 15px/1.75 -apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Arial,sans-serif;color:#2E2B26;">
  المدد الثلاث هي <strong>عادي (٤٨ ساعة)</strong> و<strong>سريع (١٨ ساعة)</strong> و<strong>عاجل (٤ ساعات، من ٧ صباحاً حتى ٧ مساءً بتوقيت القاهرة)</strong>. في حال تأخر التسليم نرد رسوم الاستعجال للمريض، لذا اختر المدد التي تناسب طريقة عملك فعلاً.
</p>

<p style="margin:0 0 26px;">
  <a href="{{servicesUrl}}" style="display:inline-block;padding:13px 26px;background:#0B6B5F;color:#ffffff;text-decoration:none;border-radius:6px;font:600 15px/1 -apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Arial,sans-serif;">
    تأكيد خدماتي
  </a>
</p>

<p style="margin:0 0 8px;font:400 14px/1.7 -apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Arial,sans-serif;color:#6B655C;">
  إذا نسيت كلمة المرور، استخدم "نسيت كلمة المرور" في صفحة تسجيل الدخول. ويمكنك الرد على هذه الرسالة إن كان أي شيء غير واضح — سيصلك رد من شخص حقيقي.
</p>

</div>
